{"id":1707,"date":"2021-02-28T21:55:15","date_gmt":"2021-02-28T21:55:15","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/?page_id=1707"},"modified":"2025-11-11T13:49:19","modified_gmt":"2025-11-11T13:49:19","slug":"aimsgmsp","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/aimsgmsp\/","title":{"rendered":"Girls In Mathematical Sciences Programme"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover is-light has-custom-content-position is-position-bottom-left pad-5\" style=\"min-height:600px\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-30 has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:#161228\"><\/span><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1288\" height=\"718\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-12033\" alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/01\/Screenshot-2024-11-29-163700.png\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/01\/Screenshot-2024-11-29-163700.png 1288w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/01\/Screenshot-2024-11-29-163700-300x167.png 300w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/01\/Screenshot-2024-11-29-163700-1024x571.png 1024w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/01\/Screenshot-2024-11-29-163700-768x428.png 768w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/01\/Screenshot-2024-11-29-163700-18x10.png 18w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1288px) 100vw, 1288px\" \/><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\">\n<h1 class=\"has-white-color has-text-color\">AIMS Girls in Mathematical Sciences Program<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-container-5 wp-block-columns\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:100%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-adv-tabs advgb-tabs-wrapper advgb-tab-horz-desktop advgb-tab-vert-tablet advgb-tab-horz-mobile advgb-tabs-45e7bb5a-3898-440a-943a-b75014b5bf64\" data-tab-active=\"0\"><ul class=\"advgb-tabs-panel\"><li class=\"advgb-tab\" style=\"background-color:#e0e0e0;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:7px\"><a id=\"\" href=\"#advgb-tabs-tab0\" style=\"color:#fff\"><span>OVERVIEW <\/span><\/a><\/li><li class=\"advgb-tab\" style=\"background-color:#e0e0e0;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:7px\"><a id=\"\" href=\"#advgb-tabs-tab1\" style=\"color:#fff\"><span>ELIGIBILITY CRITERIA<\/span><\/a><\/li><li class=\"advgb-tab\" style=\"background-color:#e0e0e0;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:7px\"><a id=\"\" href=\"#advgb-tabs-tab2\" style=\"color:#fff\"><span>PHOTOS <\/span><\/a><\/li><li class=\"advgb-tab\" style=\"background-color:#e0e0e0;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:7px\"><a href=\"#advgb-tabs-tab3\" style=\"color:#fff\"><span>APPLY<\/span><\/a><\/li><\/ul><div class=\"advgb-tab-body-wrapper\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:7px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-tab advgb-tab-body-container\"><div class=\"advgb-tab-body-header advgb-tab-class-\">OVERVIEW <\/div><div class=\"advgb-tab-_e2907d-c8 advgb-tab-body\" aria-labelledby=\"advgb-tabs-tab0\">\n<p class=\"has-red-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:#fff\" class=\"has-inline-color has-red-color\">What is the AIMS Girls in Mathematical Sciences Program?<\/mark><\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The African Institute for Mathematical Sciences &#8211; Ghana, Girls in Mathematical Sciences Program (GMSP) is a fully-funded, exciting and challenging 9-month program, created for bright, curious and creative female Senior High School students to unlock their potential in the Mathematical Sciences. It has been carefully structured to prevent interference in mainstream academics. The program operates on a hybrid model with an online and onsite session. The goal is to mentor participants to pursue STEM careers at the highest level in research, training and industry. The training is also designed to create a special class of students who will lead cutting edge research and innovation in the next few years. It is currently being implemented with support from the Government of Ghana through the Ministry of Education under the UNESCO Category II arrangement.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-red-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:#fff\" class=\"has-inline-color has-red-color\">What happens within the 9-month period of the program?<\/mark><\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>\u2022&nbsp;Monthly online meetings to train students on how to identify specific problems, probe into issues and find meaningful ways of solving these problems.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>\u2022&nbsp;Insightful virtual sessions (Masterclasses) with leading international scientists who will discuss their work and current open problems in their fields of research.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>\u2022 Career mentoring programs where researchers and AIMS alumni will enlighten participants on diverse career options available after pursuing studies in the mathematical sciences.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>\u2022&nbsp;Science communication training which will enhance the ability of participants to translate technical knowledge into practical terms that the public can engage with.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>\u2022&nbsp;Residential sessions at the AIMS Ghana campus where students take mini-courses in selected areas with a sound conceptual introduction to the profound and revolutionary ideas at the foundations of modern mathematical sciences for top 50 participants.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p> \u2022 Extracurricular activities including industry visits, hands-on interactions, meeting prominent figures and fun games for top 50 particpants.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-red-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:#fff\" class=\"has-inline-color has-red-color\">Do I need to pay any fees or other financial obligations?<\/mark><\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Selected participants of the program will not pay any fees.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h5><strong><mark style=\"background-color:#fff\" class=\"has-inline-color has-red-color\">Want to know more about the GMSP?<\/mark><\/strong><\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Find out from Cohort 2: A Transformative Journey in STEM!<br><br>The Class of 2022-2023 shares their inspiring journey! This video captures some of their experiences and growth through insightful interviews and memorable moments. Hear directly from the beneficiaries as they reflect on how the program has shaped their aspirations and future paths.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-constrained wp-block-group alignwide\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed alignwide is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"GMSP 2021\/2022 Documentary\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/fVJhXVPNs44?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-tab advgb-tab-body-container\"><div class=\"advgb-tab-body-header advgb-tab-class-\">ELIGIBILITY CRITERIA<\/div><div class=\"advgb-tab-_b135e5-46 advgb-tab-body\" aria-labelledby=\"advgb-tabs-tab1\">\n<p class=\"has-red-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size\"><strong><span style=\"color:#a51333\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Who<\/span><span style=\"color:#b10b32\" class=\"has-inline-color\"> qualifies to be a part of this program?<\/span><\/strong> <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><br>Any Ghanaian Senior High School (SHS) can nominate up to 5 female student(s) if she (or they) meet all the following requirements. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The nominated student(s):<br>\u2022 Must be a Ghanaian.<br>\u2022 Should be in SHS 1 or 2 or equivalent.<br>\u2022 Should have a passion for and strong ability in Mathematics as reflected in high school course grades and extracurricular activities.<br>\u2022 Should intend to pursue studies in STEM and\/or Mathematical Sciences at the university level in the future, and at the time of application.<br>\u2022 Should be fluent in speaking and reading and should have good listening and writing skills.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-tab advgb-tab-body-container\"><div class=\"advgb-tab-body-header advgb-tab-class-\">PHOTOS <\/div><div class=\"advgb-tab-_eb9124-5c advgb-tab-body\" aria-labelledby=\"advgb-tabs-tab2\">\n<figure class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-2 wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"787\" height=\"525\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/09\/1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5462\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/09\/1.png 787w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/09\/1-300x200.png 300w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/09\/1-768x512.png 768w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/09\/1-18x12.png 18w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 787px) 100vw, 787px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"787\" height=\"525\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/09\/IMG_1044.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5463\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/09\/IMG_1044.png 787w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploa